%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: ec4ba6a512adabf4b8a74985cb2f4d14, type: 3}
  m_Name: Chichiko Intro
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::ScriptedDialogue
  nodes:
  - type: 0
    npcLine: Your eye area. Not bad. Dehydrated, but good structure underneath. When
      did you last use a serum?
    animationTrigger: TalkBigCocky
    cameraTrigger: 
    wobbleProfileOverride: {fileID: 0}
    choices: []
  - type: 0
    npcLine: Here. Chichiko Beridze. I run the salon on Rustaveli. The last place
      in the district still doing real chemical peels.
    animationTrigger: TalkPoint
    cameraTrigger: 
    wobbleProfileOverride: {fileID: 0}
    choices: []
  - type: 0
    npcLine: Look at this. I did some filler work last Thursday. Right along the
      jaw. Self-administered, which is the only way to get the ratio exactly right.
    animationTrigger: TalkBigCocky
    cameraTrigger: SuspectFaceCam
    wobbleProfileOverride: {fileID: 0}
    choices: []
  - type: 0
    npcLine: The bruising should be fully settled by Sunday. I have done this twelve
      times. I know the timeline.
    animationTrigger: TalkPoint
    cameraTrigger: SuspectFaceCam
    wobbleProfileOverride: {fileID: 0}
    choices: []
  - type: 0
    npcLine: Anyway. Stamp it. I have three clients waiting and a delivery of imported
      hyaluronic acid coming in at noon. Come by the salon sometime. First visit
      is free. I will do something about those pores.
    animationTrigger: TalkDismissing
    cameraTrigger: 
    wobbleProfileOverride: {fileID: 0}
    choices: []
